om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/cfb85aebf711a12d3c01cfaeaecb1a97.webm?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/cfb85aebf711a12d3c01cfaeaecb1a97.mp4?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The labyrinth formed from mental traumas is filled with surreal visuals, such as inverted hanging puppets, scattered paints, and lights and shadows that have been warped and distorted.<br>While you search for a way out, you will be immersed in a combination of story and art that goes far beyond just simple puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705Six expressive boys and girls, and one... ghost cat?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/4d670d35c07a0beb7c9c67c969f83dfe.webp?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/1eedbf7c96d3cda38b45b197b1973c7d.avif?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=437 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Zena</strong>: the story's protagonist. An icy girl that loves hero shows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I should be able to do it too, just like a hero...!&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Itsuki</strong>: a boy tormented by jealousy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Gah, so annoying! You're really pissing me off. Go make me a Hamburg steak or something.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honoka</strong>: a stubborn and skeptical girl </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;In the end, it's someone else's problem. Doubting, being doubted... that's what it means to be human.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaito</strong>: a boy filled with self-doubt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Because of this scarred face, I was ostracized and called 'filthy.'&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiyori</strong>: a streamer girl and habitual liar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I'll keep on going hyper-powerfully!! Start the video!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soto</strong>: a meddlesome, yet honest boy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If you're going to do it, I'll be there to back you up.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specter</strong>: the Whimsical Watcher of the City </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Noises! Leave 'em to me~!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>\u2705How to Join the Community</strong><br>Be sure to join our Discord server! Just click &quot;Discord&quot; on the right side of the Steam page!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/a61d7505ae053e27a18fef6af7884aa3.avif?t=1759993566\" width=307 height=369 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can exchange hints about the game, share your impressions while playing, and report any bugs you come across. Why not share your own &quot;Noise&quot; as well?<br>Let's escape from <strong>Noise Scramble City</strong> together!</p>","developers":["DankHearts"],"dlc":[3866900,3867050],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/header.jpg?t=1759993566","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2507560/86024621/7b1bccb201191fb1c2678bba2b5cfccaa5cb8c0b/1757463998/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758080725","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2507560/86024